OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Frain continuing into the evening for
OL,7,Fmost areas, becoming drier for the
OL,8,FHebrides and far west later in the
OL,9,Fnight. Winds easing overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy with rain turning
OL,12,Flight and patchy, turning wintry on
OL,13,Fthe hills, Hebrides and Skye seeing
OL,14,Fthe best of any brighter weather and
OL,15,Fmilder here too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
