OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fdrier day on Wednesday but becoming
OL,7,Fwindy, rain skirting west later.
OL,8,FCloudy and damp on Friday with some
OL,9,Fwintry conditions on higher ground.
OL,10,FCold and bright Saturday, stronger
OL,11,Fwinds.
